    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d531-a2">

                <pb facs="0876" n="740" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg740"/>

                <p>The imperial consul, Becker, and the representative of the Samoan Government,
                    Brandeis, have agreed, by order of both their Governments, to the following
                    addition to the treaty of the 24th of January, 1888:</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">sole article.</hi></p>
                <p>It is left with the discretion of the imperial German consul at any time to
                    declare the withdrawal of the Imperial German Government from the treaty
                    concluded with the Samoan Government on the 24th of January, 1888.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Brandeis</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Becker</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Imperial German Consul.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Apia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1888-05-28"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 28, 1888</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
